                    IndexImage.DITHER_NONE | IndexImage.TRANSPARENCY_BITMASK);

            IndexColorModel colorModel = colorModel(indexed);

            // Even though a transparent entry is reserved in the palette...
            assertEquals(3, colorModel.getMapSize());
            assertTrue(colorModel.getTransparentPixel() >= 0);

            // ... no pixel of the opaque source image becomes transparent
            for (Integer pixel : pixels(indexed)) {
